# Hosted Website monthly: activate at go-live

Stripe checkout for `/go/website` is the **build fee only**. Monthly care does **not** start when they pay.

When the site is on hosting and people can use it, Felipe must start monthly:

```bash
node scripts/automations/stripe/start-website-monthly.mjs --email=owner@example.com --tier=practice
```

`--tier` is `brochure`, `practice`, or `full`. `--session=cs_live_…` or `--customer=cus_…` also work. Needs `Stripe_Secret_key_live` in `.env.local`.

Do not skip this. Catalogue `/go` products are one payment. They do not need this script.
